feature: trade-markers
description: |
  Implement TradeMarkers component to render buy/sell markers on the candlestick
  chart using trade data from BacktestResult.trades. Fetches trades from
  GET /api/strategies/backtest/:id and renders markers via lightweight-charts v5
  createSeriesMarkers() API. Req §25, §26, §37 MVP.

created: 2026-08-17
status: complete
phases:
  - specify: done
  - plan: done
  - tasks: done
  - implement: done
  - analyze: done
  - converge: done
kb_snapshot:
  constitution_loaded: true
  architecture_loaded: true
  modules_affected:
    - Frontend (TradeMarkers component)
    - Market Data (chart integration)
    - Strategy Engine (consumes BacktestResult.trades via REST)
